                <h3>Duplicate Receipt</h3>
                <p>
                    同一个用户重复上传自己的发票会返回 <code>200 receipt_already_uploaded</code>，客户端可以直接打开已有发票。
                    其他用户上传同一张发票会返回 <code>409 receipt_already_bound</code>，后续应进入 AA 关系流程。
                    例外：如果已有发票状态是 <code>ReviewRequired</code>、<code>RecognitionFailed</code> 或 <code>Processing</code>，当前用户可以重新上传同一张发票；系统会重新 OCR，并更新原来的 <code>receiptId</code>，不受“一张发票只能上传一次”限制。
                </p>
                <pre class="api-code"><code>200 OK
{
  "success": true,
  "duplicate": true,
  "code": "receipt_already_uploaded",
  "message": "This receipt is already uploaded by the current user.",
  "receiptId": 1,
  "duplicateReceipt": {
    "receiptId": 1,
    "appUserId": 10,
    "displayName": "Rock",
    "merchantName": "Willow",
    "total": 108.00,
    "currency": "NZD"
  }
}</code></pre>
                <pre class="api-code"><code>200 OK
{
  "receiptId": 1,
  "status": "Recognized",
