            <section id="resumable" class="api-doc-section">
                <h2>Resumable Upload</h2>
                <table class="api-doc-table">
                    <thead><tr><th>Endpoint</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Auth</th></tr></thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <tr><td><code>POST /api/spendbee/v1/receipt-uploads</code></td><td>创建一张发票的断点续传任务。</td><td>App Bearer</td></tr>
                        <tr><td><code>PUT /api/spendbee/v1/receipt-uploads/{receiptUploadId}/images/{imageUploadId}/parts/{partNumber}</code></td><td>上传或重传一个图片分片。</td><td>App Bearer</td></tr>
                        <tr><td><code>GET /api/spendbee/v1/receipt-uploads/{receiptUploadId}</code></td><td>读取续传状态、已上传分片和完成图片 URL。</td><td>App Bearer</td></tr>
                        <tr><td><code>GET /api/spendbee/v1/receipt-uploads/{receiptUploadId}/images/{imageUploadId}</code></td><td>读取已完成上传图片。返回的是鉴权代理图片流。</td><td>App Bearer</td></tr>
                        <tr><td><code>POST /api/spendbee/v1/receipt-uploads/{receiptUploadId}/complete</code></td><td>完成所有图片，创建发票并运行 OCR。</td><td>App Bearer</td></tr>
                        <tr><td><code>DELETE /api/spendbee/v1/receipt-uploads/{receiptUploadId}</code></td><td>取消未完成的上传任务。</td><td>App Bearer</td></tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
                <pre class="api-code"><code>POST /api/spendbee/v1/receipt-uploads
Authorization: Bearer sb_app_...
{
  "timezone": "Pacific/Auckland",
  "images": [
    {
      "contentType": "image/jpeg",
      "fileName": "receipt-front.jpg",
      "fileSizeBytes": 7340032
    }
  ]
}</code></pre>
                <pre class="api-code"><code>PUT /api/spendbee/v1/receipt-uploads/42/images/101/parts/1
Authorization: Bearer sb_app_...
Content-Type: image/jpeg

&lt;binary bytes&gt;</code></pre>
            </section>

            <section id="merchants" class="api-doc-section">
                <h2>Merchants</h2>
                <table class="api-doc-table">
                    <thead><tr><th>Endpoint</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Auth</th></tr></thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <tr><td><code>GET /api/spendbee/v1/merchants/recent</code></td><td>按用户最近发票列出商户。传 lat/lng 时返回距离并按远到近排序。</td><td>App Bearer</td></tr>
                        <tr><td><code>GET /api/spendbee/v1/merchants/nearby</code></td><td>拍照页用当前 GPS 获取附近商户，合并本地和 Google Places 数据。</td><td>App Bearer</td></tr>
                        <tr><td><code>POST /api/spendbee/v1/merchants/google-place</code></td><td>把 Google-only 候选商户创建或更新为本地商户。</td><td>App Bearer</td></tr>
                        <tr><td><code>GET /api/spendbee/v1/merchants/{merchantId}</code></td><td>读取商户详情和当前用户在该商户的消费记录。</td><td>App Bearer</td></tr>
                        <tr><td><code>GET /api/spendbee/v1/merchants/{merchantId}/receipts</code></td><td>读取当前用户在该商户的发票列表。这个接口和照片墙分开。</td><td>App Bearer</td></tr>
                        <tr><td><code>GET /api/spendbee/v1/merchants/{merchantId}/cover</code></td><td>读取商户封面图片。返回公开代理图片流，可直接用于客户端图片控件。</td><td>Public</td></tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
                <p class="api-doc-note">Merchant covers prefer Google Street View metadata and imagery. The server stores a small OpenAI cartoonized JPEG and returns it through the public cover proxy URL. If Street View is unavailable, merchants reuse a shared cartoon fallback by industry category. If the merchant still has no stored cover, the same cover endpoint falls back to the highest-liked ready <code>group</code> photo for that merchant. Merchant responses include latitude and longitude when known.</p>
                <pre class="api-code"><code>GET /api/spendbee/v1/merchants/recent?lat=-36.8485&amp;lng=174.7633
Authorization: Bearer sb_app_...</code></pre>
                <pre class="api-code"><code>GET /api/spendbee/v1/merchants/nearby?lat=-36.8485&amp;lng=174.7633&amp;radiusMeters=800&amp;limit=20
Authorization: Bearer sb_app_...

200 OK
{
  "lat": -36.8485,
  "lng": 174.7633,
  "radiusMeters": 800,
  "merchants": [
    {
      "source": "local",
      "merchantId": 55,
      "googlePlaceId": "ChIJ...",
      "name": "Willow",
      "address": "42 Tawa Drive, Albany",
      "latitude": -36.7355839,
      "longitude": 174.7153028,
      "distanceMeters": 120.5,
      "coverImageUrl": "https://console.sentribee.ai/api/spendbee/v1/merchants/55/cover",
      "syncStatus": "GoogleMatched",
      "canBindOnUpload": true
    },
    {
      "source": "google",
      "merchantId": null,
      "googlePlaceId": "ChIJ...",
      "name": "Nearby Cafe",
      "address": "Auckland",
      "distanceMeters": 220.1,
      "coverImageUrl": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/...",
      "syncStatus": "GoogleOnly",
      "canBindOnUpload": true
    }
  ]
}</code></pre>
                <pre class="api-code"><code>POST /api/spendbee/v1/merchants/google-place
Authorization: Bearer sb_app_...
{
  "googlePlaceId": "ChIJ..."
}</code></pre>
            </section>

            <section id="merchant-photos" class="api-doc-section">
                <h2>Merchant Photos</h2>
                <p class="api-doc-note">Merchant photos are only for the merchant gallery. Do not upload receipts or avatars here. Receipt images must use <code>/api/spendbee/v1/receipt-uploads</code>, and merchant receipt history should be read through <code>/api/spendbee/v1/merchants/{merchantId}/receipts</code>.</p>
                <p class="api-doc-note">
                    Cartoon generation is style transfer only: the backend preserves the uploaded people, food, table, storefront, and scene facts.
                    It must not infer relationships, add people, remove people, or reinterpret who is with whom.
                </p>
                <p>
                    用户照片先上传原图到 S3；完成上传后后端会用 OpenAI 统一生成卡通化展示图。原图会保存但不会在列表或图片接口中返回。
                    App 展示时使用 <code>imageUrl</code>，这是公开代理 URL，可以直接给图片控件使用。
                </p>
                <table class="api-doc-table">
                    <thead><tr><th>Endpoint</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Auth</th></tr></thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <tr><td><code>POST /api/spendbee/v1/merchant-photo-uploads</code></td><td>创建商户照片 S3 multipart 上传任务。</td><td>App Bearer</td></tr>
                        <tr><td><code>PUT /api/spendbee/v1/merchant-photo-uploads/{photoUploadId}/parts/{partNumber}</code></td><td>上传或重传一个图片分片。</td><td>App Bearer</td></tr>
                        <tr><td><code>GET /api/spendbee/v1/merchant-photo-uploads/{photoUploadId}</code></td><td>读取照片上传状态。</td><td>App Bearer</td></tr>
                        <tr><td><code>POST /api/spendbee/v1/merchant-photo-uploads/{photoUploadId}/complete</code></td><td>完成 S3 上传，保存原图，OpenAI 卡通化处理并生成展示图。</td><td>App Bearer</td></tr>
                        <tr><td><code>GET /api/spendbee/v1/merchants/{merchantId}/photos</code></td><td>读取该商户所有已处理图片，可用 category 分类过滤。</td><td>App Bearer</td></tr>
                        <tr><td><code>GET /api/spendbee/v1/merchant-photos/{photoId}/image</code></td><td>读取卡通化展示图。</td><td>Public</td></tr>
                        <tr><td><code>POST /api/spendbee/v1/merchant-photos/{photoId}/like</code></td><td>点赞或取消点赞图片。</td><td>App Bearer</td></tr>
                        <tr><td><code>GET /api/spendbee/v1/merchant-photos/{photoId}/likes</code></td><td>读取图片点赞者列表，返回头像、昵称和性别；别人给你的图片点赞时会生成消息。</td><td>App Bearer</td></tr>
                        <tr><td><code>GET /api/spendbee/v1/merchant-photos/{photoId}/comments</code></td><td>读取图片评论列表。</td><td>App Bearer</td></tr>
                        <tr><td><code>POST /api/spendbee/v1/merchant-photos/{photoId}/comments</code></td><td>新增图片评论；传 parentCommentId 时作为回复。</td><td>App Bearer</td></tr>
                        <tr><td><code>POST /api/spendbee/v1/merchant-photo-comments/{commentId}/replies</code></td><td>回复指定评论。</td><td>App Bearer</td></tr>
                        <tr><td><code>POST /api/spendbee/v1/merchant-photo-comments/{commentId}/like</code></td><td>点赞或取消点赞评论。</td><td>App Bearer</td></tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
                <pre class="api-code"><code>POST /api/spendbee/v1/merchant-photo-uploads
Authorization: Bearer sb_app_...
{
  "merchantId": 55,
  "contentType": "image/jpeg",
  "fileName": "table-photo.jpg",
  "fileSizeBytes": 5242880,
  "category": "food",
  "caption": "Brunch table"
}</code></pre>
                <pre class="api-code"><code>200 OK
{
  "success": true,
  "photoUploadId": 77,
  "uploadId": "...",
  "key": "spendbee/merchant-photos/...",
  "recommendedPartSizeBytes": 8388608,
  "uploadedParts": []
