            <section id="messages" class="api-doc-section">
                <h2>Messages</h2>
                <p>
                    SpendBee 站内消息用于通知用户上传结果和需要处理的问题。消息会带 <code>targetType</code>、<code>targetId</code> 和
                    <code>targetUrl</code>，App 点击消息后按这些字段打开对应界面。
                </p>
                <table class="api-doc-table">
                    <thead><tr><th>Endpoint</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Auth</th></tr></thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <tr><td><code>GET /api/spendbee/v1/messages</code></td><td>读取当前用户消息列表，支持分页和只看未读。</td><td>App Bearer</td></tr>
                        <tr><td><code>GET /api/spendbee/v1/messages/unread-count</code></td><td>读取未读消息数量。</td><td>App Bearer</td></tr>
                        <tr><td><code>POST /api/spendbee/v1/messages/{messageId}/open</code></td><td>App 打开消息时调用：标记已读并返回消息和最新未读数。</td><td>App Bearer</td></tr>
                        <tr><td><code>POST /api/spendbee/v1/messages/{messageId}/read</code></td><td>标记单条消息已读。</td><td>App Bearer</td></tr>
                        <tr><td><code>POST /api/spendbee/v1/messages/read-all</code></td><td>标记当前用户全部消息已读。</td><td>App Bearer</td></tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
                <p>
                    当前自动写入消息的场景包括：发票上传成功、发票识别失败、发票低置信度需要重传、低置信度发票重新识别完成、
                    商户照片上传并卡通化成功、商户照片卡通化失败、照片被点赞。头像更新不会生成消息。
                </p>
                <pre class="api-code"><code>GET /api/spendbee/v1/messages?limit=20&amp;beforeId=100&amp;unreadOnly=true
Authorization: Bearer sb_app_...

200 OK
{
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": 101,
      "messageType": "receipt_review_required",
      "severity": "Success",
      "title": "Receipt uploaded",
      "body": "Your receipt has been uploaded.",
      "targetType": "Receipt",
      "targetId": 123,
      "targetUrl": "spendbee://receipts/123",
      "payload": {
        "receiptId": 123,
        "status": "ReviewRequired",
        "estimatedErrorRate": 0.08
      },
      "readAtUtc": null,
      "createdAtUtc": "2026-06-06T03:00:00.0000000Z"
    }
  ],
  "page": {
    "limit": 20,
    "nextBeforeId": null
  }
}</code></pre>
                <pre class="api-code"><code>GET /api/spendbee/v1/messages/unread-count
Authorization: Bearer sb_app_...

200 OK
{ "unreadCount": 3 }</code></pre>
                <pre class="api-code"><code>POST /api/spendbee/v1/messages/101/read
Authorization: Bearer sb_app_...

200 OK
{
  "success": true,
  "messageId": 101,
  "message": { "...": "message with readAtUtc" },
  "unreadCount": 2
}</code></pre>
                <pre class="api-code"><code>POST /api/spendbee/v1/messages/101/open
Authorization: Bearer sb_app_...

200 OK
{
  "success": true,
  "message": {
    "id": 101,
    "targetType": "Receipt",
    "targetId": 123,
    "targetUrl": "spendbee://receipts/123",
    "readAtUtc": "2026-06-07T03:20:00.0000000Z"
  },
  "unreadCount": 2
}</code></pre>
            </section>

            <section id="assets" class="api-doc-section">
                <h2>Images</h2>
                <p>
                    以下图片接口均已实现。商户封面是公开代理 URL，可直接显示；发票相关图片仍会校验当前 app token。
                </p>
                <table class="api-doc-table">
                    <thead><tr><th>Endpoint</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Auth</th></tr></thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <tr><td><code>GET /api/spendbee/v1/receipts/{receiptId}/images/{imageId}</code></td><td>读取发票原图。</td><td>App Bearer</td></tr>
                        <tr><td><code>GET /api/spendbee/v1/receipt-uploads/{receiptUploadId}/images/{imageUploadId}</code></td><td>读取断点续传完成后的图片。</td><td>App Bearer</td></tr>
                        <tr><td><code>GET /api/spendbee/v1/merchants/{merchantId}/cover</code></td><td>读取商户封面图。</td><td>Public</td></tr>
                        <tr><td><code>GET /api/spendbee/v1/merchant-photos/{photoId}/image</code></td><td>读取用户上传照片的 OpenAI 卡通化展示图；原图不对外显示。</td><td>Public</td></tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </section>
        </main>
    </div>
